  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "非忍者路线：",
      "type": "route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "1.非忍者职业需战胜《地下竞技场》任务的艾谢巴特。（不用打轻量级和羽量级，直接打重量级就行了，具体攻略见https://www.molibaike.com/Article/Detail/7e41fda8-b9ff-45b5-9ed4-a48f4e590fd5）",
      "type": "route-prerequisite",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.前往柯马特依村，夜晚调查草料？（41.61），选“是”传送至诺斯菲拉特。",
      "type": "night-route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆柯马特依村抵达方法参考《踏足诺斯菲拉特》任务",
      "type": "route-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆选“否”进入战斗，挑战Lv.95 铁拳·艾谢巴特（不建议尝试），战斗信息：",
      "type": "optional-battle-choice",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "Lv.95铁拳·艾谢巴特（测试）：HP≈45000，MP≈43000，100闪100命中，二次行动（吃不吃咒未测试）。",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "技能：明镜止水10（战栗至140魔放不出），气功蛋10（伤害800暴击1000，战栗至70魔放不出），",
      "type": "battle-skill",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "奥义连击·舞（血量低于50%追加，伤害400+，不耗魔）",
      "type": "battle-skill",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "◆根据魔友热心举证：本任务中所涉及的所有“夜晚”限制，经实则，有可能在某些情况下无效；",
      "type": "bug-caveat",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "即白天也能执行相关操作，不确定是什么BUG",
      "type": "bug-caveat",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "3.寻找四名人才训练部队成员并与之对话，进入战斗。战斗胜利后获得相关【胜利证明】。",
      "type": "four-battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
